{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Squad: RAW Ops</strong> is a straightforward, action-packed third-person shooter. Take on the role of a RAW agent and blast your way through quick missions\u2014shoot enemies, explode barrels for slow-motion effects, rescue hostages, diffuse bombs, and find hidden intel. The gameplay is fast, fun, and easy to pick up, with a simple story that keeps you moving from one mission to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Third-Person Shooter:</strong> Easy-to-learn controls and fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Gameplay:</strong> Blast barrels to trigger slow-motion and clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Missions:</strong> Rescue, bomb defusal, and intel gathering\u2014just jump in and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Focused Levels:</strong> Perfect for quick play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Moments:</strong> Enjoy basic cutscenes and dramatic moments as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into the action, complete your objectives, and Finish all the tactical action packed missions.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875090?t=1763582674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/73a26489fd54fc5a3c7764503b80dec8c0753f7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763582674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/8028a20c75116f56f5cb62049bf3e391fb6b4a39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763582674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/8028a20c75116f56f5cb62049bf3e391fb6b4a39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763582674","categ